; List what a holder holds at a location, or print "Nothing"
;
; Lists the objects held by the holder in A (or lying at the location when A is
; $FF) that are at location B and that the actor can reach, indented by
; LIST_INDENT spaces, through #R$9FC7. When none was listed prints "Nothing".
; Used for "You see :" in a location description (#R$9F94), for the inventory
; ("<subject> is carrying.", #R$90EB, for an actor in B6EA) and for the contents of a container (#R$910E).
; .
; A Holder id, or AT_LOCATION for objects lying at the location
; B Location id
; O:HL Destroyed
@label=ListObjects
c$9FAF PUSH IY       ;
 $9FB1 PUSH DE       ;
 $9FB2 PUSH BC       ;
 $9FB3 LD C,$00      ; C counts what is listed
@isub=LD D,LIST_INDENT
 $9FB5 LD D,$04      ; indent
 $9FB7 CALL $9FC7    ;
 $9FBA SUB A         ;
 $9FBB CP C          ;
 $9FBC LD HL,$B33B   ;
 $9FBF CALL Z,$72DD  ; nothing listed: "Nothing"
 $9FC2 POP BC        ;
 $9FC3 POP DE        ;
 $9FC4 POP IY        ;
 $9FC6 RET           ;
